      "content": "When editing a load_when.agents array inside index-entries.json, check whether a co-present load_when.task_types (or commands) array already covers the same reachability before deciding an agent-name removal needs a replacement entry -- context-discovery's own loader ORs every load_when sub-array together (any(.load_when.agents) OR any(.load_when.task_types) OR any(.load_when.commands) OR .load_when.always), so removing a now-stale agent name from one sub-array is often a pure no-op for reachability, not a change requiring a substitute.",
